{"id":"wb-3-257","name":"福陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"清福陵","text":"清福陵（满语：ᡥᡡᡨᡠ᠋ᡵᡳᠩᡤᠠ ᠮᡠᠩᡤᠠᠨ，穆麟德转写：hūturingga munggan），俗称东陵，坐落在中国辽宁省沈阳市的东北郊外，为盛京三陵之一。是后金的大汗努尔哈赤的陵墓。另有努尔哈赤的后妃叶赫那拉氏、博尔济吉特氏等人葬于此处。整个陵园背靠山峦，气势宏伟，风景优美。1988年，福陵被中华人民共和国国务院公布为第三批全国重点文物保护单位之一。2004年，包括福陵在内的盛京三陵作为明清皇家陵寝的拓展项目被列入世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E7%A6%8F%E9%99%B5","revisionId":92027093,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92027093","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5210354cfaa757f462d9c271.jpg","title":"Shenyang_Fuling_Tomb2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shenyang_Fuling_Tomb2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/Shenyang_Fuling_Tomb2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"瀋陽市の福陵（東陵）","width":320,"height":240}}